  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n_rl_scope",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 300
      },
      "text": "REAR LIGHTS HARNESS (Route 15, approved 2026-10-13). All wires new (R55), factory colours. Run: J/B No.1 / left kick panel -> LH sill -> left quarter -> hatch branch to H6 -> rear panel: R11, L1, BL, R12."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_rl_feeds",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 450
      },
      "text": "FEEDS (Dan C5, DECISIONS R61): tail, stop and turn stay fed from the kept OEM J/B No.1 - tail 15A TAIL / TAIL relay out 1F-1, turn LH / RH 1F-3 / 1F-2 (flasher T3, hazard H5 and switch C15 stay OEM, C8), stop 15A STOP through S9 pin 1. Back-up: reverse relay k_rev in the glove-box LOGIC box (ST185-CabinPower), its contact fed from the J/B No.1 GAUGE 15A fuse, coil from the back-up switch B1 on ST185-B-engine; 87 arrives broken off. 16 AWG behind the 15A fuses, 18 AWG behind the 10A TURN fuse (fuse protects the thinnest wire)."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_rl_ground",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 750
      },
      "text": "GROUND: all rear lamps, H6 included -> sp_rl_gnd -> body ground BL. Full notes: docs/harness/HARNESS-NOTES.md, ST185-RearLights."
    }
  ],
